{"id":"638257","name":"青瓜拌大虾","author":"琪_feXjZ8E2","authorId":"10602029","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/638257/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"青瓜","amount":"一条"},{"name":"大虾","amount":"十只"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备:海虾处理好挑去虾线。","img":"images/638257/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"青瓜，香菜。","img":"images/638257/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"香菜切碎，剁点蒜末，放入大碗面。","img":"images/638257/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"电煮锅里水烧开放入姜，海虾烫熟。","img":"images/638257/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"青瓜削去部分皮改刀切段装大碗面。","img":"images/638257/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把虾剥壳放入大碗面。","img":"images/638257/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"调酱油，香油，香醋，糖。","img":"images/638257/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"抓拌均匀即可品尝。","img":"images/638257/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/638257/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/638257/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}